Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear about your disappointment with the <strong><em>-gluten intolerant/vegetarian/etc-</em></strong> meal on board your flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We've always taken pride in the quality of the catering we serve on board, from simple snacks to special meals we provide for customers with <em><strong>-dietary/religious- </strong></em>requirements.<br />
<br />
Our menus are curated by an expert team, including chefs and nutritionists, who ensure the ingredients used appeal to as broad a range of tastes as possible.<br />
<br />
I understand that this wasn’t the case on your flight and appreciate your frustration.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that your comments have been passed on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
